<header class="ref-head yr-head"><p class="cty-kicker">Year by year · <a href="/centuries/5th-century-bce">5th century BCE</a></p><h1 class="research-title">479 BCE</h1><p class="ref-lede">479 BCE in world history: 7 events, 2 deaths, 1 work and 1 state founded. 339 recorded states existed that year.</p></header>
<nav class="ref-letters yr-near" aria-label="Nearby years"><a href="/years/539-bce">539 BCE</a><a href="/years/480-bce">480 BCE</a><a href="/years/479-bce" aria-current="page">479 BCE</a><a href="/years/404-bce">404 BCE</a><a href="/years/338-bce">338 BCE</a><a href="/years/331-bce">331 BCE</a><a href="/years/323-bce">323 BCE</a></nav>
<section><h2 class="ref-sec-title">Events</h2><ol class="day-events yr-events"><li class="tih-event-card"><div class="tih-event-main"><p class="tih-event-year"><a href="/today-in-history/august-27">27 August</a></p><h3 class="tih-event-title">Greeks defeat the Persian army at Plataea</h3><p class="tih-event-desc">A Greek alliance led by <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/sparta">Sparta</a> defeated the Persian army of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/mardonius">Mardonius</a> at <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/battle-of-plataea">Plataea</a>, on a date traditionally placed in late August. The victory ended <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/persia">Persia</a>'s invasion of mainland <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/greece">Greece</a>.</p><div class="tih-tags"><a class="tih-tag enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/sparta">Sparta</a><a class="tih-tag enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/greece">Greece</a></div></div></li><li class="tih-event-card tih-has-thumb"><a class="tih-event-thumb" href="/encyclopedia/battle-of-plataea" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/battle-of-plataea.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="168" height="112"></a><div class="tih-event-main"><p class="tih-event-year">Battle</p><h3 class="tih-event-title"><a href="/encyclopedia/battle-of-plataea">Battle of Plataea</a></h3><p class="tih-event-desc">The Battle of Plataea was fought in 479 BCE in Boeotia, where an allied Greek army led by Sparta defeated the Persian land forces under Mardonius.</p></div></li><li class="tih-event-card tih-has-thumb"><a class="tih-event-thumb" href="/encyclopedia/battle-of-mycale" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/battle-of-mycale.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="168" height="112"></a><div class="tih-event-main"><p class="tih-event-year">Battle</p><h3 class="tih-event-title"><a href="/encyclopedia/battle-of-mycale">Battle of Mycale</a></h3><p class="tih-event-desc">The Battle of Mycale was fought in 479 BCE at Mount Mycale on the coast of Ionia, opposite Samos.</p></div></li></ol></section>
